---
/**
 * Day list - a daily puzzle built on real iNaturalist records.
 *
 * Six species were all recorded at one place in one month. They are revealed
 * commonest-in-the-world first, so each one narrows the map further. The
 * visitor drops a pin and picks a month; reading fewer species scores higher.
 *
 * Behaviour lives in @/lib/hobbies/day-list, bound via [data-daylist-*].
 * Photos load from the iNaturalist CDNs already allow-listed in the CSP.
 */
interface Props {
  heading?: string;
}
const { heading = "Day list" } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="dl not-prose mt-14" aria-label={heading} data-daylist>
  <header class="dl-head">
    <p class="u-label">Daily puzzle</p>
    <h2 class="dl-title">{heading}</h2>
    <p class="dl-lede">
      Six species, all recorded at one real place in one month. Work out where
      on earth that was, and which month.
    </p>
  </header>

  <ol class="dl-steps">
    <li>
      <span class="dl-steps__n">1</span>
      <span
        >They arrive <strong>most widely recorded first</strong>. A dandelion
        narrows nothing; the sixth species is often local enough to name the
        valley.</span
      >
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="dl-steps__n">2</span>
      <span
        >Drop a pin on the map and pick a month. You can guess after any number
        of species.</span
      >
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="dl-steps__n">3</span>
      <span
        >Guessing early is worth more. Reading all six makes it easy, so it only
        scores about half. A pin anywhere inside the real boundary is exact.</span
      >
    </li>
  </ol>

  <div class="dl-grid">
    <!-- the notebook -->
    <div class="dl-book">
      <div class="dl-book__head">
        <p class="u-label">Species recorded here</p>
        <p class="dl-book__count" data-daylist-counter>1 of 6 read</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="dl-clues" data-daylist-clues></ol>
      <button type="button" class="dl-btn dl-btn--wide" data-daylist-more>
        Read the next species
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- the guess -->
    <div>
      <div
        class="dl-mapwrap"
        data-daylist-mapwrap
        tabindex="0"
        role="application"
        aria-label="World map. Click or tap to drop a pin where you think the list was written. Arrow keys move the pin."
      >
        <canvas data-daylist-map></canvas>
        <p class="dl-maphint">Tap anywhere to drop your pin</p>
      </div>

      <div class="dl-ask">
        <p class="u-label dl-ask__label">Which month were they there?</p>
        <div
          class="dl-months"
          data-daylist-months
          role="group"
          aria-label="Choose a month"
        >
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="dl-lockrow">
        <p class="dl-readout" data-daylist-readout>
          Drop a pin on the map, then choose a month.
        </p>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="dl-btn dl-btn--go"
          data-daylist-lock
          disabled>Lock it in</button
        >
      </div>

      <div data-daylist-result></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="dl-foot">
    Every species is a research-grade iNaturalist record from that place in that
    month, and every location is a real place with a published boundary. The bar
    on each line is how often the species is <em>recorded</em> worldwide, which tracks
    how much people look as well as where it lives, so treat it as a hint rather than
    a range map. Species are marked native, introduced or endemic using iNaturalist's
    establishment means for that place. Photos are Creative Commons and credited to
    the photographer.
  </p>
</section>

<script>
  import { initDayList } from "@/lib/hobbies/day-list";

  document
    .querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-daylist]")
    .forEach((el) => initDayList(el));
</script>

<style is:global>
  /* Global rather than scoped, and namespaced under .dl so nothing leaks.
     Astro's scoped styles only reach markup present at build time, and the
     clue rows, month buttons and result card are all built by the script at
     runtime, so scoping would silently miss them. */

  /* Follows the archive's paper/ink palette rather than introducing a new one:
     rules instead of cards, one accent-free column of type. */
  .dl {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding-top: 22px;
  }

  .dl-head {
    max-width: 62ch;
  }
  .dl-title {
    margin: 4px 0 0;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .dl-lede {
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }

  .dl-steps {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    max-width: 72ch;
  }
  .dl-steps li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: baseline;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .dl-steps__n {
    flex: none;
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 999px;
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    transform: translateY(2px);
  }
  .dl-steps strong {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .dl-grid {
    margin-top: 22px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 22px;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .dl-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 20rem) minmax(0, 1fr);
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  /* ---------------- notebook ---------------- */
  .dl-book {
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .dl-book__head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    background: var(--band);
  }
  .dl-book__count {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .dl-clues {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .dl-clue {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-soft);
  }
  .dl-clue__num {
    flex: none;
    width: 12px;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    padding-top: 2px;
  }
  .dl-clue__photo {
    flex: none;
    width: 46px;
    height: 46px;
    object-fit: cover;
    background: var(--band);
  }
  .dl-clue__body {
    min-width: 0;
    flex: 1;
    display: block;
  }
  .dl-clue__name {
    display: block;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .dl-clue__sci {
    display: block;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin-top: 1px;
  }
  .dl-clue__bar {
    display: block;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--rule-soft);
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .dl-clue__bar i {
    display: block;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .dl-clue__meta {
    display: block;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin-top: 4px;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .dl-clue--hidden {
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .dl-clue__wait {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  /* ---------------- map ---------------- */
  .dl-mapwrap {
    position: relative;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    aspect-ratio: 2 / 1;
    cursor: crosshair;
    touch-action: manipulation;
  }
  .dl-mapwrap canvas {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .dl-maphint {
    position: absolute;
    left: 8px;
    bottom: 8px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--paper) 88%, transparent);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: 3px 7px;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity 0.25s;
  }
  .dl-mapwrap.is-placed .dl-maphint {
    opacity: 0;
  }

  /* ---------------- month ---------------- */
  .dl-ask {
    margin-top: 14px;
  }
  .dl-ask__label {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    display: block;
  }
  .dl-months {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
    gap: 4px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 560px) {
    .dl-months {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
    }
  }
  .dl-month {
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--ink-3);
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 11px;
    padding: 7px 0;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .dl-month:hover {
    background: var(--hover);
  }
  .dl-month[aria-pressed="true"] {
    background: var(--ink);
    border-color: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
  }
  .dl-sr {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: -1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }

  /* ---------------- actions ---------------- */
  .dl-lockrow {
    margin-top: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .dl-readout {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .dl-btn {
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--ink);
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 12px;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .dl-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background: var(--hover);
  }
  .dl-btn:disabled {
    opacity: 0.4;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }
  .dl-btn--wide {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    border: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: 11px 12px;
  }
  .dl-btn--go {
    background: var(--ink);
    border-color: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
  }
  .dl-btn--go:hover:not(:disabled) {
    opacity: 0.88;
    background: var(--ink);
  }

  /* ---------------- result ---------------- */
  .dl-result {
    margin-top: 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .dl-result__head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    background: var(--band);
  }
  .dl-result__place {
    margin: 3px 0 0;
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .dl-result__region {
    margin: 2px 0 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .dl-result__score {
    text-align: right;
  }
  .dl-result__total {
    margin: 3px 0 0;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .dl-breakdown {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    margin: 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .dl-breakdown > div {
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .dl-breakdown > div:last-child {
    border-right: 0;
  }
  .dl-breakdown dt {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .dl-breakdown dd {
    margin: 3px 0 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .dl-result__note {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .dl-result__note strong {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .dl-result__note--quiet {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule-soft);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .dl-share {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0 14px;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .dl-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .dl-next {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  /* ---------------- photo credit ---------------- */
  /* CC BY and CC BY-NC both require the photographer to be named, so the
     credit rides with the thumbnail rather than living in a footnote. */
  .dl-clue__credit {
    display: block;
    font-size: 9px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin-top: 3px;
  }

  /* ---------------- standing tags ---------------- */
  .dl-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: 1px 5px;
    margin-left: 5px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    vertical-align: 1px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .dl-tag--introduced {
    border-color: var(--ink-2);
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .dl-tag--endemic {
    border-color: var(--ink);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  /* ---------------- the whole list ---------------- */
  .dl-rollwrap {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: 12px 14px 4px;
  }
  .dl-rollwrap__label {
    display: block;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }
  .dl-rolls {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .dl-roll {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 10px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-soft);
  }
  .dl-roll:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }
  .dl-roll__photo {
    flex: none;
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    object-fit: cover;
    background: var(--band);
  }
  .dl-roll__body {
    min-width: 0;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .dl-roll__name {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }
  .dl-roll__sci {
    margin: 1px 0 0;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .dl-roll__fact {
    margin: 5px 0 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .dl-roll__meta {
    margin: 5px 0 0;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .dl-roll__link {
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .dl-roll__credit {
    margin: 3px 0 0;
    font-size: 9px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  .dl-actions a.dl-btn {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .dl-actions a.dl-btn:hover {
    text-decoration: none;
    background: var(--hover);
  }

  .dl-foot {
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    max-width: 72ch;
  }
</style>
